<title>USA: Bank of Commerce bids for Fallbrook.</title>
<headline>Bank of Commerce bids for Fallbrook.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Commerce said it submitted an offer to enter talks with Fallbrook National Bank to acquire Fallbrook in a stock exchange of two shares of Bank of Commerce shares for five shares of Fallbrook National.</p>
<p>It said it believes the proposal represents a better than 2-1/2 times book value to FNB Shareholders.</p>
</text>
